<title>FRANCE: BNP holding in Lagardere slips to 4.5 pct.</title>
<headline>BNP holding in Lagardere slips to 4.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Nationale de Paris (BNP) has reduced its holding in Lagardere to below five percent and now holds 4.49 percent, the financial regulator Conseil des Marches Financiers said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that BNP said the transaction took place on May 22 and that, as of that date, it held 5,263,385 shares in publishing group Lagardere.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
